# Visual direction

This site is a **cassette-futurist** electronics catalog, not a celestial editorial portfolio and not generic “retro.”

Before changing UI, layout, type, color, or decorative assets, read [docs/aesthetic.md](docs/aesthetic.md).

Keep the information architecture and motion (nav, loader, curtain, scramble, recorder, theme toggle, tiles, case-study bands). Restyle only the skin unless the user asks to change structure.

Do not introduce synthwave neon, vaporwave, Y2K chrome, glassmorphism, soft drop shadows, or sky/sun/moon hero art.
